{"title":"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of a pizza with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> percent larger than the area of a pizza with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> inches. What is the integer closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/7/7f7bb8de3de7dff8ebb6635db611d15225c990e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 25 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 33 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 44\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 66 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of the larger pizza is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/6/a8614a7ac3a38794811c563d39185fa13a00d684.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, while the area of the smaller pizza is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2eddbf4a36b15c84cd5a99fb11d9817bc2978d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9\\pi$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />. Therefore, the larger pizza is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e335e4e09fdd871c3b3f14d325a2126c27f25af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7\\pi}{9\\pi} \\cdot 100\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"78\" height=\"37\" /> bigger than the smaller pizza. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/f/b4ffd04bb23c5384f8af7e0d36bbc8aa8b0daf70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7\\pi}{9\\pi} \\cdot 100\\% = 77.777....$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"172\" height=\"37\" />, which is closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/0/d402dd292b8baf83ae043a11969779dba203233b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }78}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"63\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SbUEin-OE-k\">https://youtu.be/SbUEin-OE-k</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A\">2019 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></t